GEMM ctx, sc, vh, nn
WRITECOL att, ctx, 1792, 128
SLICE qh, q, 1920, 128
SLICE kh, k, 128, 128
SLICE vh, v, 128, 128
ROPE qrot, qh, theta1, 0
ROPE krot, kh, theta1, 0
GEMM sc, qrot, krot
SCALE sc, sc, scale1
